    "body_preview": "## Description  The FAQ states:  > `django-environ` will try to get and read `.env` file from the project root if you haven\u2019t specified the path for it when you call `environ.Env.read_env()`.  It then defines the project root as the directory containing `manage.py`.  However, this does not match the current implementation of `Env.read_env()`:  https://github.com/joke2k/django-environ/blob/9c1fc30b...",
