    "body_preview": "Currently, `valkey://` and `valkeys://` URL schemes fall back to the Redis cache backend (`django.core.cache.backends.redis.RedisCache` or `django_redis`).  Since [django-valkey](https://django-valkey.readthedocs.io/) is the dedicated backend for Valkey (using the native `valkey` package), it should be preferred when configuring Valkey cache schemes.  ## Proposed Solution Use django_valkey.cache.V...",
